  "guid": "com.mekka.deadlygas",
  "name": "Deadly Gas (realistic extract)",
  "slug": "deadly-gas-realistic-extract",
  "teaser": "More realistic end of raid - survive the gas after the timer runs out ! Use gas mask to stay longer !",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/R4CSyD6kraLTxXbdgi9YwbsTJpU7jYZOrIclI98E.png",
  "downloads": 1045,
  "favourites_count": 12,
  "description": "<h1>Deadly Gas — realistic end-of-raid</h1>\n<p>Replaces the arbitrary end-of-timer MIA with a <strong>deadly gas</strong>: when the raid\ntimer expires, the zone slowly fills with gas (green haze + fog) and your\nhealth drains : about 3 minutes to die at full health (configurable). You can\nstill run for the extract: extracting during the gas counts as a normal\n<strong>Survived</strong>. Dying in the gas is a normal death. No more MIA screen at\n2 meters from the extract.</p>\n<p>Gas masks allow you to stay 3 times longer in the gas.\nRespirators allow you to stay 1.5 times longer in the gas.</p>\n<p><strong>Client-side</strong> BepInEx plugin. Nothing to install server-side.</p>\n<h2>Install</h2>\n<p>Extract it into your SPT folder (the one with\n<code>SPT.Launcher.exe</code>). The DLL lands in <code>BepInEx/plugins/MekkaDeadlyGas.dll</code>.</p>\n<h2>Configuration</h2>\n<p>In game via <strong>F12</strong> (Configuration Manager) or in\n<code>BepInEx/config/com.mekka.deadlygas.cfg</code>:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Setting</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n<th>Effect</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Enabled</td>\n<td>on</td>\n<td>Master switch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minutes before death</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Survival time in the gas at full health (chest-based)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gas rise (seconds)</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>Grace period before damage starts</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visual effects</td>\n<td>on</td>\n<td>Green tint + fog</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tint intensity</td>\n<td>0.45</td>\n<td>Green overlay opacity (0.2 subtle → 0.7 pea soup)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fog density</td>\n<td>0.06</td>\n<td>Fog thickness at full ramp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Probe mode</td>\n<td>off</td>\n<td>Diagnostic dumps for troubleshooting</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Known quirks</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>After expiry the in-raid timer display shows ~24h instead of 00:00\n(cosmetic only, the gas is your real timer now).</li>\n<li>AI Scavs are unaffected.</li>\n<li>Works in PMC and player-Scav raids. Untested with Fika/coop.</li>\n</ul>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2818/deadly-gas-realistic-extract",
  "fika_compatibility": false,
  "featured": false,
  "contains_ads": false,
