  "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>AI was used as a coding assistant during the conception of this project. It helped with structure, debugging, cleanup work and some documentation wording.</p>\n<p>The actual mod direction, content, balancing, IDs, testing and final decisions are handled by myself.\nNothing was added blindly without review or testing. Coding is part of my job, I’m 46 and working in IT since 2005.</p>\n",
